    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ファァァ～～～！
な、何ここ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Woooo~oooow!
Wh-What is this place!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293824</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すっごいね。
遊園地かなぁ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is amazing. Maybe
it's an amusement park?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっほー。
はじめまして、かな？　かな？
ここの事教えてあげようか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey there. This is your first time, is it?
Is it? Should I tell you allll about it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>う、うん。
ボクたち初めてきたかラ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Y-Yeah. This is the first
time we've come here...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここはね、嗜好の楽天地、
その名も『&lt;Red&gt;ナム孤島&lt;White&gt;』って、
言うんだお∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is none other than that paradise
of taste, "&lt;Red&gt;Nam Cobanda Isle&lt;White&gt;"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大人も、子どもも、男も女も、
人じゃない方々も、
だ～れでも、楽しめる場所さ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Adults, children, boys and girls, and even
those who aren't people at all are
aaaaaalll invited to enjoy themselves here!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294248</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だれでも、って事は、
タダなのか!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, if "everyone" is welcome,
does that mean it's all free!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294436</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、うん、入るのは、
誰でもタダだにょ～。
遊ぶにはちょとお金が必要だすが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, yeah, anyone can enter for
free~! But, you do need just a
little money for the attractions.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294436</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だから、そこの、動く木箱とか、
ゴムマリみたいな獣とかでも
入るのは自由だよ～ん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So even your animate crate and
your rubber ball beastie there
are free to enter~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だーれが、木箱だ、え？
おめぇのその変な着ぐるみ、
燃やして火だるまにすっぞ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Who're ya callin' a crate, huh? I'll set
that weird little costume of yours on
fire! Turn ya into a big ol' blaze!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はいはい、すごいすごい。
怖い怖いってね。
だから、適当に楽しんできな～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, yes, truly incredible.
I'm so, so, so scared. So,
do try to enjoy yourselves!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よーし、
さっそく入ってみっか。
行くぜ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aaaallright! Let's get
in there already!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ハゲぼうず、待つだ！
抜け駆けは許さないだーよ！！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait for me, ya numbskull! Don't
ya dare go and start without me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294880</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クッルール！！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Colleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294964</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ね、エト、
とりあえず、
わたしたちも行ってみようよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm. Well, let's give
it a try too, Ethos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295032</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだね。
せっかく来たんだもんね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sure. We already came all
the way here, after all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
